        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Major boo booty twitch and a crew rich bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Always wanted to say that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Ever since the days of hallways taunting a stray cat",
