        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Enough to have the game trapped and bound",
          "rhyme": "awnd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Scratched in the crown was the names of lames who yapped a noun",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Or verb for that matter",
          "rhyme": "e",
