    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Known for his absurd word choices",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And will ignore you if you ask him if he heard voices",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Look, the energy is crazy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Far as he was concerned the enemy was lazy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Ahem, your attention please",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Freeze, he came to seize the free cheese",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Before he flees to Belize",
          "rhyme": "Ez",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "In case he forgot to mention, squeeze these",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Just keep it on a need to know basis",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "They knew he was a negro so no need to show faces",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Back in the days of no laces",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "On a slow pace they used to say he might could go places",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Ehh, whatever their case is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "The card he played was ace of spades, but no races",
          "rhyme": "as",
